Anbieter senden. Abschließend bleibt festzuhalten: Datenschutz ist keine einmalige Aufgabe. Wer diese Schritte befolgt, schützt seine Daten also deutlich wirksamer. Zusätzlich sollten Passwörter regelmäßig geändert werden.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Techblog: Datenschutz im Browser einfach erklärt","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"b2-58-textkohaerenz-absatzlogik","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Timo, kannst du mal über mein Anschreiben schauen?","speaker":"Anke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_058_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-58-textkohaerenz-absatzlogik","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Ich weiß nicht, wo ich anfangen soll.","speaker":"Anke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_058_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-58-textkohaerenz-absatzlogik","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Am besten stellst du dich zuerst kurz vor, dann begründest du deine Motivation.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_058_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-58-textkohaerenz-absatzlogik","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Und danach?","speaker":"Anke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_058_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-58-textkohaerenz-absatzlogik","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":5,"text":"Dann fasst du am Ende alles noch mal knapp zusammen — ein Absatz, eine Idee, das reicht.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_058_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-58-textkohaerenz-absatzlogik","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-58-textkohaerenz-absatzlogik","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"